<title>USA: TALX says prices initial offer at $9/shr.</title>
<headline>TALX says prices initial offer at $9/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>TALX Corp said its initial public offering of two million shares of common stock was priced at $9 per share.</p>
<p>The computer systems company said net proceeds from the offering will be used to repay debt and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>TALX said its shares began trading Thursday on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol TALX.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
